  "text": [
    "Boat anglers found decent numbers of salmon 55 to 100 feet down in 90 to 120 feet of water.",
    "Anglers venturing offshore found a mix of steelhead and coho salmon in 200 to 250 feet of water.",
    "The morning bite was very good compared to the evening bite.",
    "Glow plugs worked well in low-light conditions.",
    "Pier anglers caught a few bass and freshwater drum on ned rigs, with no salmon reported from the piers."
